 -Doesn't require RealPlayer G2 <br> <br>-maggot physics™</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>-Dark humor <br> <br>-Skins  <br><br><u>EXOTIC LOCATIONS!!!!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The Living Room<br> <br>-The Kitchen<br><br> -The Porch<br><br>-The Bedroom<br><br>-The Bathroom<br> <br> -The Sewer<br> <br>-Behind the couch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>-Behind the fridge!<br> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > we hope you enjoy another Residual Christmas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392930/extras/61c070b859e54f5ef8932cac13dce0be.avif?t=1781766941\" width=400 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signed Mortimer J. Maggot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas Spirit (Residual)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p>", "short_description": "Risen from the Html grave of the 2000's, Mort is back feeding on what's left... Wishing you a pricey Christmas.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392930/header.jpg?t=1781766941", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392930/3cc17f0b5e2a3abcc3c2f88fb144a0a2ec4b5f60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781766941", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392930/3cc17f0b5e2a3abcc3c2f88fb144a0a2ec4b5f60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781766941", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 64-bit (latest Service Pack)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i3 3250 3.5 GHz or Intel Pentium G4560 3.5 GHz / AMD FX-4350 4.2 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graph